# Hadice private / CI environment file
# Copy to `.env.ci` and fill in real values. `.env.ci` is gitignored and must NOT be committed.
#
# Used by:
# - Frontend (Vite): variables prefixed with VITE_ are injected into the JS bundle at build time
# - Backend (Go): `task gen:cienv` / build deps bake selected keys into `backend/cienv_generated.go`
# - Local `task dev`: backend also loads this file from the project root at runtime
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT copy `.env.ci` into the app package. Official releases embed values at
# build time only. After a release build, reset generated secrets before committing:
#   rm -f .env.ci && task gen:cienv
# (or restore the empty defaults in backend/cienv_generated.go)

# ---------- PostHog analytics ----------
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
# Backend may reuse the same project key
POSTHOG_API_KEY=
POSTHOG_CAPTURE_URL=https://us.i.posthog.com/capture/

# ---------- App links ----------
VITE_UPDATE_CHECK_URL=
VITE_DOCS_URL=
